  triage:title "runtime_health.rs:903 timing assertion budget too tight — 1s budget vs 10ms deadline" ;
  triage:description "runtime_health.rs:903 — timing assertion uses 1s budget when the actual operation deadline is 10ms. Under CI scheduling jitter this can fail. Widen the test assertion budget to 5s to match CI timing tolerance." ;
